{%- comment -%}
  Stylesheets of the main product. The rarely needed parts only load on the products that use them (CSS budget):
  logo upload (-print), bundle (-bundle), configurator (-config), 'Premium of Professional?' (-compare), discontinued /
  binnenkort / back-in-stock form (-status), video and 3D (-media). Params: product, is_print, is_config, is_discontinued,
  avail_status, media_types (comma list of the product's media types).
  section-main-product.css: aliases --pk Kiezel, --pi Inkt, --pl Lijn, --pw Wit, --p4/6/7 font weights, --pr/--pri radii,
  --pd duration, --pck check mark; written with native CSS nesting (as Shopify Horizon) to stay inside the CSS budget.
  The narrow buy button (phones, two-column tablets) puts the live total on a second line; in the delivery block the
  'Meer over verzenden' link is set off with a dot so it reads as its own item.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign is_bundle = false
  if product.metafields.custom.componenten != blank
    assign is_bundle = true
  else
    for v in product.variants
      if v.metafields.custom.componenten != blank
        assign is_bundle = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  echo 'section-main-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  if is_print
    echo 'section-main-product-print.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
  if is_bundle
    echo 'section-main-product-bundle.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
  if is_config
    echo 'section-main-product-config.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
  if product.metafields.custom.vergelijk_groep != blank
    echo 'section-main-product-compare.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
  # -status also carries the back-in-stock form, so it loads when any variant is sold out (a variant change can show it)
  assign any_out = false
  for v in product.variants
    unless v.available
      assign any_out = true
      break
    endunless
  endfor
  if is_discontinued or avail_status == 'binnenkort' or any_out
    echo 'section-main-product-status.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
  if media_types contains 'video' or media_types contains 'model'
    echo 'section-main-product-media.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag
  endif
-%}
